[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.7[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[list]
[*]New Body preset row in Customize > Body. Pick a preset with left and right or from the list; it shows Custom once you move a body slider.
[*]The Template row now only holds palettes and combinations.
[*]Outfits keep their textures on game versions CSS has not verified. Materials that use the game's own shaders are rebuilt on your game's shaders, so Eve, Commander White, Genessa and Profane Proxima no longer turn gray there.
[*]New Misc > Compatibility > Outfit materials setting: Auto (default), Always game shaders, or Off.
[*]CSS.log now lists your game version and every installed outfit with its version.
[/list]

[b]Troubleshooting[/b]
Parts of an outfit still gray? Update the outfit to its latest version, set Misc > Compatibility > Outfit materials to Always game shaders, and send CSS.log (Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/CustomShellSystem/CSS.log).

Requires CSS Shared Assets 1.0.7.
